== Abstract ==

This document specifies an upgrade that changes Bitcoin's proof-of-work algorithm from SHA256d to BLAKE2b.

The new proof of work uses a new block header format, which also incorporates fixes for several long-standing protocol limitations that could not be corrected without changing the block header.
It commits to the block height and transaction count, provides additional mining nonce space, permits timestamp rolling without revealing the real block time to hashing hardware, and provides a dedicated merge-mining commitment.

