== Backward compatibility ==

This upgrade is not backward compatible.

Before <code>activation_height</code>, historical block headers and block identifiers are unchanged.
Beginning at <code>activation_height</code>:

* block headers gain the fields specified above;
* version bit 31 selects the new header format;
* block identifiers and proof of work use the construction in this document;
* the target receives a one-time adjustment;
* the height and transaction-count commitments are enforced; and
* headers with version bit 31 clear are invalid.

The [[bip-blake2b-servicebit.mediawiki|peer-services specification]] defines the version-selected header serialization and service-bit advertisement.
The separate [[bip-blake2b-mining-interface.mediawiki|mining-interface specification]] defines the getblocktemplate changes.
Block-file layout, indexing, and other local implementation details are left to implementations.

